# Day bundles of real people are health data, and this repository is public and
# is what Render builds from.  Only the synthetic demo day and the schema are
# tracked; a real bundle copied here stays on this machine.
backend/bundles/*
!backend/bundles/demo/
!backend/bundles/bundle.schema.json
